sequenceDiagram
  actor Viewer
  participant UI as Rewind UI
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant STT as STT Provider
  participant RET as Retrieval
  participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
  participant LLM as LLM Provider
  participant TTS as TTS Provider
  Viewer->>UI: Push to talk
  UI->>API: Audio + movie ID + playback position + spoiler mode
  API->>STT: Transcribe audio
  STT-->>API: Recognized question
  API->>RET: Query + movie scope + time boundary
  RET->>DB: Hybrid search with filters
  DB-->>RET: Timestamped candidate chunks
  RET->>RET: Filter, rank, deduplicate
  RET-->>API: Bounded evidence
  API->>LLM: Question + policy + evidence
  LLM-->>API: Answer + evidence references
  API->>API: Validate evidence and uncertainty
  opt TTS enabled
    API->>TTS: Synthesize validated answer
    TTS-->>API: Audio
  end
  API-->>UI: Answer + citations + optional audio
  UI-->>Viewer: Show/speak answer; allow resume playback
